IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PROMPTCACHE-PML.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TEXT-LEN            PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MODULE-ID           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 POSITION-ID         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 HIT-RATIO-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PROMPTCACHE-PML.
    IF TEXT-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF TEXT-LEN > 10
        MOVE 85 TO HIT-RATIO-PCT.
    ELSE
        MOVE 40 TO HIT-RATIO-PCT.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 HIT-RATIO-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 MODULE-ID.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
